<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.1.1>	Insigne sanctum tempus acceptabile!
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.1.2>	Adsunt salutis dies uenerabiles.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.1.3>	Plenis oliuo sponso cum lampadibus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.1.4>	Curramus omnes obuiam palmifero,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.1.5>	Mundi superbo superato principe.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.2.1>	Caste pieque uiuamus et sobrie
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.2.2>	Soli tremendo seruientes domino
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.2.3>	De corde puro, totisque praecordiis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.2.4>	Laudes feramus dei sapientie,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.2.5>	Quae nos redemit pretioso sanguine.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.3.1>	A paradysi laetabundis gaudiis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.3.2>	Nos traxit olim ciborum cupiditas,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.3.3>	Portas polorum dulcedo gluttifera
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.3.4>	Clauserat, alta dispensante gratia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.3.5>	Quae nos reduxit ad caelorum limina.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.4.1>	Nos laeta traxit caro de paradyso,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.4.2>	Misit in huius seculi exilium,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.4.3>	In lacrimarum ualle delitiscimus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.4.4>	Diris ligati peccatorum uinculis:
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.4.5>	Afflicta modo reducat ad sidera.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.5.1>	Ieiuniorum sunt sacrata tempora,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.5.2>	In quibus hostis bellum mouit inuidus.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.5.3>	Ne sanctitatis cumulentur merita,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.5.4>	Temptationum infigit aculeos,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.5.5>	Quos sola sedat singularis bonitas.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.6.1>	Ieiuna uincit uitiorum milia
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.6.2>	Diuina caro suffragante gratia,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.6.3>	Resistit irae, refrenat libidinem,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.6.4>	Dat castitatis triumphale praemium,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.6.5>	Cingit corona uirginalem uerticem.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.7.1>	Moyses, electus domini tirunculus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.7.2>	Petre sub antro quadraginta dierum
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.7.3>	Ieiuniorum consecrauit ferias,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.7.4>	Ut possit almo legem scriptam digito
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.7.5>	Sancta sub aure leniter suscipere.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.8.1>	Propheta sanctus Helias abstinuit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.8.2>	Continuatis totidemque diebus,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.8.3>	Ionas dicauit triduani temporis
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.8.4>	Niniuitarum celebre ieiunium,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.8.5>	Detersit omne criminis piaculum.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.9.1>	Fons pietatis, infinita bonitas
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.9.2>	Suscepta carne, quadraginta diebus
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.9.3>	Iesus redemptor ore nullum pertulit
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.9.4>	Potum cibumque, sacro sub ieiunio
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.9.5>	A spiritali fame nos eripuit.
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.10.1>	Gloria deo sit patri perenniter,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.10.2>	Sit semper honor alti nato nominis,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.10.3>	Virtus, potestas sanctoque spiritui,
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.10.4>	Sit trinitati decus et imperium
<paulin_aquil. carm. 11.10.5>	Per infinita saeculorum <saecula>.
